{"name_en": "Aurelia Severa", "zh": "塞維拉", "sei": "塞", "mei": "維拉", "zh_full": "奧勒利婭·塞維拉", "sex": "f", "years": [213, 213], "birth": null, "death": 213, "death_violent": true, "polity": "羅馬帝國", "role": "宗教", "place": "羅馬", "lat": 41.9, "lon": 12.5, "offices": ["維斯塔貞女"], "kin": [], "friends": [], "foes": ["Caracalla"], "bio": "維斯塔貞女。卡拉卡拉以失貞之罪處死四名貞女，塞維拉與克洛狄婭·萊塔同遭活埋。", "stats": [10, 10, 40, 30, 50], "lean": "無", "conf": "B", "src": "Dio 77.16"}
